{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03352","headline":"宋公宅送甯谏议 · 宋之问","name":"宋公宅送甯谏议","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"宋公爰创宅，庾氏更诛茅。\n间出人三秀，平临楚四郊。\n汉臣来绦节，荆牧动金铙。\n尊溢宜城酒，笙裁曲沃匏。\n露荷秋变节，风柳夕鸣梢。\n一散阳台雨，方随越鸟巢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03352.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03352","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}